---
/**
 * The stats beacon (D-063), as a component so it can be left out entirely.
 *
 * Astro hoists a <script> whenever the component that carries it renders, so
 * the only way to ship no beacon when `statsEnabled` is off is to not render
 * the component — Analytics.astro does exactly that. The meta is the runtime
 * half of the same switch: scripts/beacon.ts registers nothing without it.
 * Nothing else may import scripts/beacon.ts (see the note in that file).
 */
---

<meta name="nb:stats" content="1" />

<script>
  import '../scripts/beacon';
</script>
